  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Program Support Platform (FPSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Platform will be a mechanism capable of responding to a range of service requirements, from the provision of inputs to meet new and immediate needs (e.g. emergency response); ad hoc support for separately managed activities; through to management and implementation of sector programs sitting beneath the &#x2018;umbrella&#x2019; of the Platform.</narrative>
  </description>
